# Daniels returns a creature card from its controller's graveyard on entry, then its graveyard ability puts Daniels on the
# library bottom as a cost and gains 2 life (CR 118.3, 401.4, 603.6a).
# Daniels, Temporal Agent {2}{B/G}{B/G}: Legendary Creature — Human Advisor
#   When Daniels enters, return target creature card from your graveyard to your hand.
#   {2}, Put this card from your graveyard on the bottom of your library: You gain 2 life.
# Bot2's Walking Ballista is in Bot2's graveyard, not Bot1's, so it is no target and stays. The graveyard ability can't be
# activated while Daniels is on the battlefield (CR 113.6m), only once Daniels is in the graveyard.

